From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:55:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] hunt: tools to run the reproducers against any commit of
 the history

scripts/hunt_bisect0/at_commit.sh builds tests/hunt_bisect0.rs or
tests/hunt_cuts.rs against the sources of a commit, in a target directory
of its own: a shared one links the library an earlier export built, since
the root package's artifact name does not depend on the checkout path and
git archive gives the files their commit times. hookport.pl puts the
forcing pause of the snapshot schedule into a commit that has the
published forms; diagport.pl puts the stale-cut counter into one that has
rebase_tables. The test file gets a switch for the commits that can hold
a seal but cannot count the frozen tables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
